..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRINTQUEUE.GEDRUCKT
.. Autor          : saac
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : teamreport
.. Funktion       : Weitergabe des Druckstatus aus den Zeilen des Infosystems
.. Functionality  : Executes fo command ".printed" for documents.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue END ? P|vorschau
.continue SUCCESS ? P|erg = 0
..
!FAILED: Print process failed
.copy M|statusz = M|rotz
.continue END
..
!SUCCESS: Document was printed
.assign M|statusz = M|gruenz
.copy M|printable = G|FALSE
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
